-Remaining differences:
-The reconstruction uses a 384-body local physics pool, staged initialization on three very dense maps, a bounded support graph, and 20 simplified convex hulls. Original remote configuration, existing-device preferences, and exact cross-platform PhysX trajectories cannot be reproduced from the packaged assets alone. These limitations prevent a claim of bit-for-bit identical behavior.
