-Written UTC: 2026-10-13T09:42:04.809064+00:00
-Scope: read-only source/native-record review. No gameplay change or Unity launch.
-
-Finding
-No off-by-one error is proven. The diagnostic tuple group=0, switch=6,
-enabled=1, aperture approximately 1.689 is expected for this source model.
-The switch threshold is metadata only for Robot Red: it has no conditional
-complex, simple, or special collider arrays. Its ungrouped capsule stays enabled.
-Do not change growth thresholds, collider dimensions, or collection physics to
-make a test bot succeed on the basis of this tuple.
-
-Original serialized evidence
-- Audit/CollectableMetadata.json: modelId/id 255, GameObject path ID
-  -1232821164249908849; complexColliders=[], simpleColliders=[],
-  specialColliders=[], complexColliderCount=0, simpleColliderCount=0,
-  useSpecialCollider=0. isHoleColliderActivated=0;
-  holeLevelToActivateSC=1 is the prefab default, not an active geometry group.
